content+=callout('Listening notes, not a certified transcript','<p>Passage descriptions are based on automatic working transcripts. Names, numbers and overlapping speech can be wrong. No complete speaker map has been established. The original filename is retained for citation, and timestamps always belong to that file.</p><p>These are 48 kb/s mono listening copies for manageable web delivery. Original audio remains in the family collection. The introductory Hela interview is Tape 1 - 2, followed by Tape 1 - 1.</p>')
