content+=section('The recent conversation',p('The November 2026 transcription of Mark, Natalie and Luba’s conversation adds Masie’s nickname, Arke’s story, the possibly misleading Krugersdorp explanation and other family leads. Without timestamps or reliable speaker labels, this site attributes the account to the conversation rather than to one participant. Its relevant findings are incorporated in the chapters; the raw recent conversation and unsupported allegations are not published as a historical transcript.','recent','mark'))
